  "focus": "title matches /airport|aiport|aéroport|aeroport|aeropuerto|flughafen|luchthaven|lufthavn|flyplass|летищ|airfield|aerodrome|aérodrome|airstrip|heliport|helipad|helicopt|hélicopt|runway|airspace|aviation|aircraft|\\bflights?\\b|air traffic|air passenger|air transport|air freight|airline|air carrier|metar|\\btaf\\b|\\buas\\b|drone|adsb|ads-b|opensky|luftfahrt|luftverkehr|flugh|low flying|obstacle limitation|\\bafb\\b|air base|\\barpt\\b/i AND NOT title or subcategory matches /ortho|aerial|luftbild|seam ?lines|cutting lines|flight ?lines|flight paths of the|vlieglijnen|image flight|bildflug|photo exposure|drone flight paths|drone locations|beetle|scolyt|migration and flight/i AND NOT title matches /benzol|benzene|ozone|carbon monoxide|nitrogen|sulph|sulfur|particulate|pm10|pm2|contribution rates|airport line/i AND NOT url matches /request=getcapabilities/i",
